<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-TRANSVAAL 255-3 AT TEA AGAINST GRIQUA W.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TRANSVAAL 255-3 AT TEA AGAINST GRIQUA W.</headline>
<dateline>KIMBERLEY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transvaal were 255 for three at tea on the opening day of their Supersport Series four-day match against Griqualand West in Kimberely on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Transvaal 255-3 (Adam Bacher 116 not out, Neil McKenzie 84) v Griqualand West.</p>
